<title>USA: Fleet share offer gets 30 pct response.</title>
<headline>Fleet share offer gets 30 pct response.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Financial Group Inc said on Friday that more than 30 percent of its 11 million outstanding Series V Depositary Shares have been tendered in exchange for its Trust Originated Preferred Securities.</p>
<p>The offer having expired at midnight January 30, the exchange is expected to be completed on February 4. The Trust Originated Preferred Securities will begin trading on the New York  Stock Exchange on February 5 under the  symbol FLTpfH.</p>
</text>
